<section aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
  <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Design philosophy</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Local-first</strong> — no cloud, no sync, no vendor lock‑in.</li>
    <li><strong>Deterministic</strong> — predictable behavior across platforms and releases.</li>
    <li><strong>Minimal</strong> — no hidden magic, no surprise background processes.</li>
    <li><strong>Reproducible</strong> — testable behavior, stable interfaces, clear invariants.</li>
    <li><strong>Honest</strong> — no overpromising; limitations are documented, not hidden.</li>
  </ul>
</section>